   "source": [
    "The utilization rate rate show us which portion of the charging station is being used at a time. This KPI helps us to get a better understanding of demand & user patterns. When the utilization is high then normally the demand is also high which may suggest to expand capacity at a site or provide good support for the given time frame. In correspondence to that does a low utlization rate means low demand and therefore highlights inefficiencies at a given time or site.\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\\text{Utilization Rate} = \\frac{\\text{time charging stations were in usage}}{\\text{total time available for usage}}\n",
    "$$"
   ]
  },
